    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Arcanists given a precious gift of magical prowess, sorcerers can tap into their own inner reserves to provide more Mana for casting.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Sorcerers</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Yennefer, The Witcher</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Elsa, Frozen</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Ganondorf, The Legend of Zelda</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Storm, X-Men</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Sorcerer</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The sorcerer is a squishy blaster focused on Casting Spells for instant burst damage. You should stay in safety to Cast.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Cast</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Backline</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Influence</span></p>",
